{"3361190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ZOPHARION", "steam_appid": 3361190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >☣️ ZOPHARION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here, survival instinct is all that matters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in a place where technology exists only to prolong agony.<br>The research station has become an ecosystem of hunters that <strong>see, hear, and react to your every move.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/127395c6227c34d59cbbc7eac1c30a4c.poster.avif?t=1775216744\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/127395c6227c34d59cbbc7eac1c30a4c.webm?t=1775216744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/127395c6227c34d59cbbc7eac1c30a4c.mp4?t=1775216744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🩸 FIGHT, CLINCH, OR FLEE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ZOPHARION, every second is a decision.<br><strong>A mistake is a death sentence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical Clinch</strong> — when an enemy catches you, you lose control.<br>Struggle. Push back. Break free.<br><strong>Your energy drains — and so do you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Melee</strong> — fight with whatever you find.<br><strong>Miss once — it’s over.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape</strong> — some cannot be defeated.<br><strong>You run or you die.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/ab98b80cfabe0a03993c78ff8b55460f.poster.avif?t=1775216744\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/ab98b80cfabe0a03993c78ff8b55460f.webm?t=1775216744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/ab98b80cfabe0a03993c78ff8b55460f.mp4?t=1775216744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚖️ NO WAY BACK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You encounter survivors.<br><strong>Every choice has a cost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help them — you lose resources.<br>Ignore them — you lose them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your decisions reshape the station. There’s no going back.</strong>👁️ CAMERAS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surveillance is your eyes.<br><strong>But images can lie.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the cameras, you find codes, access cards, and a way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the monitors, you’ll see things that shouldn’t be there.<br><strong>Not everything you see is real.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/860e643c255fbe586e61bebac7c06dc1.poster.avif?t=1775216744\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/860e643c255fbe586e61bebac7c06dc1.webm?t=1775216744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/860e643c255fbe586e61bebac7c06dc1.mp4?t=1775216744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔩 EQUIPMENT &amp; RESOURCES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path is blocked.<br><strong>You have to find a way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You use tools and gather what you need to move forward.<br><strong>Every action risks noise.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn’t loot. It’s time.</strong><br>• battery = minutes of visibility<br>• meds = seconds of life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You burn through them faster than you find them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/48f3e090f3f43fbe90d49c8d7fe0588d.poster.avif?t=1775216744\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/48f3e090f3f43fbe90d49c8d7fe0588d.webm?t=1775216744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/48f3e090f3f43fbe90d49c8d7fe0588d.mp4?t=1775216744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 INTERACTION &amp; PRESSURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world reacts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You push objects, block passages, and create your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You solve puzzles while being watched.<br><strong>One mistake gets you killed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/3f1232f5c93e25de8a92d3b9f0c3876d.poster.avif?t=1775216744\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/3f1232f5c93e25de8a92d3b9f0c3876d.webm?t=1775216744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/3f1232f5c93e25de8a92d3b9f0c3876d.mp4?t=1775216744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>🔻 CORE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have no advantage.</strong><br><strong>Only decisions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every action costs. Every cost buys time.</strong><br><strong>And you’re running out of it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👉 <strong>ADD TO WISHLIST</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >☣️ ZOPHARION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here, survival instinct is all that matters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in a place where technology exists only to prolong agony.<br>The research station has become an ecosystem of hunters that <strong>see, hear, and react to your every move.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/127395c6227c34d59cbbc7eac1c30a4c.poster.avif?t=1775216744\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/127395c6227c34d59cbbc7eac1c30a4c.webm?t=1775216744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/127395c6227c34d59cbbc7eac1c30a4c.mp4?t=1775216744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🩸 FIGHT, CLINCH, OR FLEE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ZOPHARION, every second is a decision.<br><strong>A mistake is a death sentence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical Clinch</strong> — when an enemy catches you, you lose control.<br>Struggle. Push back. Break free.<br><strong>Your energy drains — and so do you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Melee</strong> — fight with whatever you find.<br><strong>Miss once — it’s over.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape</strong> — some cannot be defeated.<br><strong>You run or you die.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"