 &amp; RESOURCES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path is blocked.<br><strong>You have to find a way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You use tools and gather what you need to move forward.<br><strong>Every action risks noise.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn’t loot. It’s time.</strong><br>• battery = minutes of visibility<br>• meds = seconds of life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You burn through them faster than you find them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/48f3e090f3f43fbe90d49c8d7fe0588d.poster.avif?t=1775216744\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/48f3e090f3f43fbe90d49c8d7fe0588d.webm?t=1775216744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/48f3e090f3f43fbe90d49c8d7fe0588d.mp4?t=1775216744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 INTERACTION &amp; PRESSURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world reacts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You push objects, block passages, and create your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You solve puzzles while being watched.<br><strong>One mistake gets you killed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/3f1232f5c93e25de8a92d3b9f0c3876d.poster.avif?t=1775216744\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/3f1232f5c93e25de8a92d3b9f0c3876d.webm?t=1775216744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361190/extras/3f1232f5c93e25de